  "keyFeatures": [
    "Antinuke protection with configurable modules, thresholds, and punishments",
    "Full moderation suite: bans, kicks, mutes, jail, warnings, lockdown",
    "Music playback from YouTube, Spotify, SoundCloud, and Apple Music",
    "Last.fm integration with crowns, scrobble tracking, and server stats",
    "Leveling system with XP rewards, role milestones, and leaderboards",
    "Webhook-based event logging with per-channel, per-event configuration",
    "VoiceMaster — user-created temporary voice channels with interface panel",
    "Welcome, goodbye, and boost messages with variable placeholders",
    "Support ticket system with claim, transcript, and staff role controls",
    "Autoroles for humans and bots on server join",
    "Starboard for highlighting popular messages",
    "Collaborative counting channel"
  ],
